{"id":"t94YXFYGNNyuNBi","name":"king_spawn_talking","type":"sequence","entries":[{"id":"ADUC7O9ZMgyaZRG","name":"menu_main_command_run","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"core-menu menuMain %player_name%","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"oJiRV3aNw6f25Di","name":"sound_king","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"value":"entity.pillager.ambient","type":"default"}},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"G7Ii2KZMU5zR8lb","name":"first_spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["jGBrBzan8yebolA","oJiRV3aNw6f25Di"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"Mi viajero de otro mundo… Recuerda: aquí solo yo sé de dónde vienes. Para los demás eres un forastero más, y es mejor así.","duration":3000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"APtfcIeiVnKGrgo","name":"open_main_menu","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"core-menu menuMain %player_name%","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"JRYAWzgKY16rrmM","name":"first_option","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["HxO3dufl20XUd7I","l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"Los reyes de esta tierra guardamos la crónica de los Llegados. Si el pueblo supiera que vienes de otro mundo, te verían como un milagro… o como una amenaza.","duration":2500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"zZ0L7ouNlgcMhHR","name":"second_option","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["l3HHh9nExc3dmRt","HxO3dufl20XUd7I"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"Esto es lo que queda del Antiguo Imperio: un reino que resiste tras sus muros mientras la <#9EE37D>Maleza</#9EE37D> pudre la tierra. Más allá, el mundo es salvaje, enorme… y tuyo.","duration":2500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"ULJEjv9nrrZ7amF","name":"third_option","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["HxO3dufl20XUd7I","l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"No lo sé. Ninguno de los que llegaron antes volvió. Pero si este mundo te trajo hasta aquí, es porque te necesita.","duration":2500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"jGBrBzan8yebolA","name":"player_options","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["oJiRV3aNw6f25Di"],"speaker":"IiY432VLyYHg26J","text":"¿Qué quieres preguntarle al Rey?","options":[{"text":"¿Por qué solo tú sabes de dónde vengo?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["JRYAWzgKY16rrmM"]},{"text":"¿Qué es este mundo?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["zZ0L7ouNlgcMhHR"]},{"text":"¿Puedo volver a mi mundo?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["ULJEjv9nrrZ7amF"]}],"duration":2000,"type":"option","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"YHYOwZc5FavARAE","name":"main_king_options","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["oJiRV3aNw6f25Di"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"Rey del Antiguo Imperio, guardián de los Llegados","options":[{"text":"<#C38BFF>✦ Mostrar la Llave de Raíz","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":4},{"fact":"kWiCKeGPJTGR9ot","operator":">=","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["JGEmrc3DOws85Nr"]},{"text":"<#C38BFF>✦ Bram forjó una llave para ti…","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":">=","value":4},{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"<=","value":6},{"fact":"kWiCKeGPJTGR9ot","operator":"==","value":0}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["S1sw1FdURCQiFqH"]},{"text":"<#F86363>✦ Abrir las puertas de Orian","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":6},{"fact":"kWiCKeGPJTGR9ot","operator":">=","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["SxMGGBFNTEjNmss"]},{"text":"<#E0C28A>✦ Entregar la Crónica Restaurada","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":15},{"fact":"O6vPcgKXIu9FimN","operator":">=","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["BkD7W3WAOn7v0jz"]},{"text":"<#E0C28A>✦ Aldric te envía una crónica…","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":15},{"fact":"O6vPcgKXIu9FimN","operator":"==","value":0}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["aDuUyb8PTcUYrKS"]},{"text":"<#C38BFF>✦ ¿Qué pasará ahora?","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":16}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["Qs4bIR2BgnKqOZa"]},{"text":"Hablar con <yellow>King Draemir</yellow>","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["G7Ii2KZMU5zR8lb"]},{"text":"Abrir el <#49F527>Menú Principal","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["APtfcIeiVnKGrgo"]},{"text":"Regresaré después <red>Cerrar</red>","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["HxO3dufl20XUd7I"]}],"duration":1000,"type":"option","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"0qhydjMUlqbsYzF","name":"music_during_talking","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"value":"music.dragon","type":"default"}},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"xbwWwNbTZlQaFqE","name":"king_interaction","triggers":["0BFn7BwpkZ01BZG","oJiRV3aNw6f25Di","YHYOwZc5FavARAE","3GHNRG7jznyGTd6","BtBJNDk4dCi3hmu","YFj49N66wM2PlIp","GD4fc2jDmt9qrnR","BBtGaprBPhLERW0","zjQ05OI43qHdKCR"],"definition":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","shiftType":"ANY","interactionType":"ALL","type":"entity_interact_event","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"3GHNRG7jznyGTd6","name":"stop_all_sounds","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["0qhydjMUlqbsYzF"],"sound":{"enabled":false,"value":{"type":"default","value":""}},"type":"stop_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"EH4SGXPDzKk5DBZ","name":"tutorial_rey_libro","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["qpUhYzbObKqntcq","rtqzOWKNz2x6k7t"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"Este libro llegó contigo. Está casi en blanco: lo que recuerdes de tu otra vida y lo que vivas aquí quedará escrito en él.","duration":2500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"rtqzOWKNz2x6k7t","name":"tutorial_sonido_rey","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"entity.pillager.ambient"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.8,"pitch":0.9},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"qpUhYzbObKqntcq","name":"tutorial_rey_funciones","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["PQaTKGrskWllylM"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"Con él tendrás todo a mano: <yellow>Pase de Batalla</yellow>, <yellow>Mascotas</yellow>, <yellow>Tienda</yellow>, <yellow>Trabajos</yellow>, <yellow>Misiones</yellow> y <yellow>Duelos</yellow>.","duration":2500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"PQaTKGrskWllylM","name":"tutorial_rey_mision","criteria":[],"modifiers":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"=","value":2},{"fact":"26auCJp8cHzlQEW","operator":"=","value":2}],"triggers":["3rcZXgWF7CtOEUs","JKfBmxs8xTcUtQJ","fI6Fk3G0XTTvv27"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"Tu alma aún arrastra ecos de tu antigua vida. Ve al <#7FB2FF>Eco de los Recuerdos</#7FB2FF> y recordarás quién eras. Y una cosa más: que nadie sepa de dónde vienes. Sigue el rastro blanco.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"3rcZXgWF7CtOEUs","name":"tutorial_titulo_mision","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"title":"<#7FB2FF>ɴᴜᴇᴠᴏ ᴅᴇꜱᴛɪɴᴏ","subtitle":"<#C9CDD6>ᴇᴄᴏ ᴅᴇ ʟᴏꜱ ʀᴇᴄᴜᴇʀᴅᴏꜱ","durations":{"enabled":true,"value":{"fadeIn":500,"stay":3500,"fadeOut":800}},"type":"show_title","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"JKfBmxs8xTcUtQJ","name":"tutorial_sonido_mision","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"block.amethyst_block.chime"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.8,"pitch":1.2},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"YFj49N66wM2PlIp","name":"tutorial_rey_recuerdo","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":-1}],"modifiers":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"=","value":4},{"fact":"BVjb2A1NPXIyzSr","operator":"=","value":1}],"triggers":["1j4WfmA5uf4INBG","Gy3sXhdptfC7hCg","ZWzfDD8wLuW6RQp","qb3ohf6WeqPeGWy"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"¿Lo notaste? Has recuperado un recuerdo de tu otra vida. Desde ahora tu historia se guarda y puedes leerla con <yellow>/historia</yellow>.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"1j4WfmA5uf4INBG","name":"tutorial_titulo_historia","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"title":"<#FFD36B>ʜɪꜱᴛᴏʀɪᴀ","subtitle":"<#C9CDD6>ᴜꜱᴀ /ʜɪꜱᴛᴏʀɪᴀ","durations":{"enabled":true,"value":{"fadeIn":500,"stay":4000,"fadeOut":800}},"type":"show_title","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"Gy3sXhdptfC7hCg","name":"tutorial_sonido_historia","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"ui.toast.challenge_complete"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.6,"pitch":1.0},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"ZWzfDD8wLuW6RQp","name":"tutorial_consola_historia","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"tutorial historia %player_name% 1\ntutorial paso %player_name% 4","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"qb3ohf6WeqPeGWy","name":"tutorial_rey_ve_al_guardia","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"Ahora ve con el <yellow>Guardia Real</yellow>. Para él eres un forastero que necesita equipo, y es mejor que siga siendo así. Sigue el rastro blanco.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"BtBJNDk4dCi3hmu","name":"tutorial_bloqueo_rey","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":">=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"<=","value":4}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"message":"<#FFD36B>King Draemir <dark_gray>» <#C9CDD6>Ve, forastero. Lo que buscas está al final del rastro blanco.","type":"action_bar_simple_message","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"fI6Fk3G0XTTvv27","name":"tutorial_consola_paso_2","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"tutorial paso %player_name% 2","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"hU2bHhFxPoIPNwR","name":"escena_libro_del_rey","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["nYP3u1RRj4WglJo"],"blockChatMessages":true,"blockActionBarMessages":true,"page":"iBCZxB7gkzNFbvp","type":"cinematic","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"GDinouxZjugnDD5","name":"rey_intro_destello","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"location":{"enabled":true,"value":{"world":"Lobby","x":54.5,"y":33.6,"z":-12.5,"yaw":0.0,"pitch":0.0}},"particle":"END_ROD","count":40,"offset":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5,"z":0.5},"speed":0.08,"type":"spawn_particles","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"7Nb5srpS9wg1QlR","name":"rey_intro_sonido_mira","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"block.amethyst_block.chime"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":1.0,"pitch":0.7},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"RLiiRejeKx0gbVC","name":"rey_intro_oscuridad","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"potionEffect":"darkness","duration":2500,"amplifier":0,"ambient":true,"particles":false,"icon":false,"type":"add_potion_effect","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"3lrAmSJ2km14IKC","name":"tutorial_rey_intro_3","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["GDinouxZjugnDD5","7Nb5srpS9wg1QlR","RLiiRejeKx0gbVC","hU2bHhFxPoIPNwR"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"Moriste en tu mundo y despertaste en el mío. No temas: no eres el primero en cruzar… pero sí el primero en mucho tiempo. Mira.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"H9R1YpX4nVrRtdV","name":"rey_intro_almas","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"location":{"enabled":true,"value":{"world":"Lobby","x":54.5,"y":33.6,"z":-12.5,"yaw":0.0,"pitch":0.0}},"particle":"SCULK_SOUL","count":12,"offset":{"x":0.7,"y":0.7,"z":0.7},"speed":0.02,"type":"spawn_particles","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"lC1fDBUiTue7fiP","name":"rey_intro_latido","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"entity.warden.heartbeat"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.7,"pitch":1.0},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"zjQ05OI43qHdKCR","name":"tutorial_rey_intro_1","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["H9R1YpX4nVrRtdV","lC1fDBUiTue7fiP","3lrAmSJ2km14IKC"],"speaker":"Mv89CaytjuA5znG","text":"*El viejo rey se levanta del trono al verte.* Así que la profecía era cierta… <yellow>has llegado</yellow>. Soy <yellow>Draemir</yellow>, Rey de este reino. Y tú no eres de aquí, ¿verdad?","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"GD4fc2jDmt9qrnR","name":"rey_intro_despertar","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":1}],"modi